## Commands

| Command | What it does |
|---|---|
| `npm run dev` | Local preview at http://localhost:4321 |
| `npm run build` | Validate content and build static HTML into `dist/` |
| `npm run check:launch` | Fails while any `[[CONFIRM: ...]]` placeholder remains |

## Where things live

| Path | Contents |
|---|---|
| `theme.json` | Colors, fonts, corner radius, spacing density |
| `content/site.json` | Business name, navigation, footer |
| `content/pages/*.json` | One file per page; each page is a list of sections |
| `public/` | Images and other static files |
| `src/custom/` | Customer-specific code (see its README) |

## Deploy

`dist/` is plain HTML/CSS. Deploy it to any static host (Netlify, Cloudflare Pages, Vercel, S3, nginx).
